---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../../lib/siteConfig";

const updated = "March 26, 2026";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description={`Privacy policy for ${siteConfig.name}.`} noIndex>
	<Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: "Privacy Policy" }]} />

	<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-mute">Last updated {updated}</p>
		<div class="prose prose-neutral mt-8 max-w-none prose-headings:font-extrabold prose-headings:text-ink prose-p:text-body prose-li:text-body dark:prose-invert">
			<p>
				At {siteConfig.name}, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This
				Privacy Policy outlines the types of information collected and recorded by {siteConfig.name}
				and how we use it.
			</p>
			<h2>Information we collect</h2>
			<p>We may collect personal information such as:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Name and email address (when you subscribe or contact us)</li>
				<li>Any information you voluntarily provide through forms</li>
				<li>Technical data like IP address, browser type, and device information</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>How we use your information</h2>
			<p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Operate and maintain our website</li>
				<li>Improve user experience and content</li>
				<li>Communicate with users, including responding to inquiries</li>
				<li>Send newsletters or updates (only if you opt in)</li>
				<li>Prevent fraud and ensure security</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>Cookies and web beacons</h2>
			<p>{siteConfig.name} uses cookies to:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Store visitor preferences</li>
				<li>Understand user behaviour on our site</li>
				<li>Improve website functionality, including your language and dark/light mode preference</li>
			</ul>
			<p>You can choose to disable cookies through your browser settings.</p>
			<h2>Advertising partners</h2>
			<p>
				We may use third-party advertising services like Google AdSense. Google uses cookies (such
				as the DoubleClick cookie) to serve ads based on a user's visit to our site and other
				websites.
			</p>
			<h2>Third-party privacy policies</h2>
			<p>
				Our Privacy Policy does not apply to other advertisers or websites. We advise you to review
				the respective privacy policies of any third-party ad servers or websites for more detailed
				information about their practices.
			</p>
			<h2>External links</h2>
			<p>
				Our website may contain links to other websites. We are not responsible for the privacy
				practices or content of those external sites.
			</p>
			<h2>Children's information</h2>
			<p>
				{siteConfig.name} does not knowingly collect any personal identifiable information from
				children under the age of 13. If you believe your child has provided such information,
				please <a href="/contact/" class="font-semibold text-primary">contact us</a> and we will
				remove it immediately.
			</p>
			<h2>Data security</h2>
			<p>
				We take reasonable measures to protect your information from unauthorised access, misuse,
				or disclosure. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.
			</p>
			<h2>Your consent</h2>
			<p>By using our website, you consent to this Privacy Policy and agree to its terms.</p>
			<h2>Updates to this policy</h2>
			<p>
				We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this
				page with an updated revision date.
			</p>
			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>
				Questions about this policy? Email us at
				<a href="mailto:bullorbearstrategies@gmail.com" class="font-semibold text-primary"
					>bullorbearstrategies@gmail.com</a
				> or <a href="/contact/" class="font-semibold text-primary">contact us</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
